<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form name="frmWoD20_15" align="client" theme="dark">
	<!--
		The VAMPIRE tab (user 2026-10-01, SPEC I188e/f, V530). It began as a copy of the Ghoul tab
		(WoD20.11.lfm) without the DOMITOR box, and it edits the SAME fields: clanDisc_*, disc_*,
		mainPath_*, secPath_*, ritual_*, bloodPool_*. The two are never open together - Vampire opens
		when the game is Vampire, and Ghoul closes then (SPEC Q107.1) - so one set of data never shows
		under two sets of limits.

		Every NAME here carries a V after its role prefix: dynV, btnQV, edtV, ro_V, dragRow_V, plus
		vdot and vcap. The import is pasted into the ROOT constructor (measured in the generated Lua),
		so a name repeated from WoD20.11 would be the same self.<name> and xpFind would keep one of the
		two (SPEC V530e). The role prefix stays first on purpose: the language traversal leaves dyn*
		alone (SPEC V31), and so it does here.

		No <script> and no dataLink. The painters are WoD20.11's and the root's and walk both infixes
		(SPEC I188g); the two events at the bottom call those same painters for this tab's first show.
		The WILLPOWER copy's dots (roVWp_) are WoD20.3's to paint - paintWillpower, through xpFind
		(57th batch, SPEC I200e, V545c).

		NINE dots a row, and the generation is the ceiling (SPEC I188h, V529): every live dot vdot has
		a twin vcap on the same spot - no field, EMPTY, at 30%. renderVampCaps shows the live dot up to
		the generation's level and the twin above it, so a dot out of reach reads as an empty faded dot,
		like a trait never bought (54th batch, user 2026-10-02, SPEC I197b, V543), and takes no click.
		The pool's twins are empty too (SPEC Q115.1). The main paths' read-only dots (ro_V) get the same twin. Nothing is erased: a dot bought above a ceiling that came down later stays
		in the sheet, under its twin (SPEC V220c, V187). Rituals carry no dots, as on Ghoul (SPEC Q107.2).
	-->
	<scrollBox align="client">
		<image name="themePaper15" align="client" style="stretch" hitTest="false" visible="false"/>

		<!-- BLOOD POOL takes the left of the band the DOMITOR box left behind: fifty dots in FIVE rows of
		     ten since the 46th batch (user 2026-10-01, SPEC I189f, V533), on the step and margins of the
		     Ghoul's twenty (26 apart, 30 down, 24 from the edge) - so the box is 307 x 218 and the whole
		     band grew to 218 with it. The generation caps it (SPEC I188c): bloodClick reads bloodCap, and
		     the dots past the pool show their faded twin. The Main draws the same block (SPEC I189d).

		     Since the 50th batch (user 2026-10-02, SPEC I193f) the rows are 25 down, the step of the
		     ability rows. The Main's block keeps its 30 (SPEC Q111.2).

		     Since the 53rd batch (user 2026-10-02, SPEC I196c, V533a) the box is TIGHT on the grid:
		     first row 1 below the title, like every titled box (SPEC Q112.2), and the house foot of
		     15 (SPEC V393) - 36 + 125 + 15 = 176, and the whole band came down to 176 with it.

		     A vampire with the True Faith merit takes a band of 204 (user 2026-10-06, SPEC I214, V551):
		     VTF_GEOM grows the box and moves the title and the hundred dots down 14, so the block stays
		     centred. Without the merit GEOM_XML puts them back where they stand here. -->
		<layout name="boxVPool" left="0" top="10" width="307" height="176">
			<rectangle align="client" color="black" xradius="14" yradius="14" cornerType="innerRound"/>
			<label name="lblVPool" left="20" top="15" width="267" height="20" text="BLOOD POOL" horzTextAlign="center"/>
			<imageCheckBox name="vdotbloodPool_1" left="24" top="36" width="25" height="25" field="bloodPool_1" checkedImage="images/prime_on.png" uncheckedImage="images/prime_off.png" autoChange="false" onClick="bloodClick('bloodPool_1', self);"/>
			<imageCheckBox name="vdotbloodPool_2" left="50" top="36" width="25" height="25" field="bloodPool_2" checkedImage="images/prime_on.png" uncheckedImage="images/prime_off.png" autoChange="false" onClick="bloodClick('bloodPool_2', self);"/>
			<imageCheckBox name="vdotbloodPool_3" left="76" top="36" width="25" height="25" field="bloodPool_3" checkedImage="images/prime_on.png" uncheckedImage="images/prime_off.png" autoChange="false" onClick="bloodClick('bloodPool_3', self);"/>
			<imageCheckBox name="vdotbloodPool_4" left="102" top="36" width="25" height="25" field="bloodPool_4" checkedImage="images/prime_on.png" uncheckedImage="images/prime_off.png" autoChange="false" onClick="bloodClick('bloodPool_4', self);"/>
			<imageCheckBox name="vdotbloodPool_5" left="128" top="36" width="25" height="25" field="bloodPool_5" checkedImage="images/prime_on.png" uncheckedImage="images/prime_off.png" autoChange="false" onClick="bloodClick('bloodPool_5', self);"/>
			<imageCheckBox name="vdotbloodPool_6" left="154" top="36" width="25" height="25" field="bloodPool_6" checkedImage="images/prime_on.png" uncheckedImage="images/prime_off.png" autoChange="false" onClick="bloodClick('bloodPool_6', self);"/>
